prior_attempt = "The supplied attempt-1 evidence records failures in TestRepair_131_SnapshotGrowth and TestRepair_131_EscrowReceiptBinding; this continuation preserves their contract assertions."
snapshot-growth = "TestRepair_131_SnapshotGrowth drives 512 real agent streams, proves atomic refusal of the 513th metadata entry, and proves bounded recovery JSON export/import/reopen; its unchanged declared_genesis_contract subtest exercises the application JSON contract with 1034 live kernel records. GenesisState.Validate retains per-record bounds, duplicate checks and gate checks without a lifetime kernel count cap that live writers do not enforce."
